hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"28024","Narrated Yazid ibn Harun, he said: informed Abdullah ibn Umar, from Al-Qasim ibn Ghannam, from his household, from his grandmother Umm Farwah, that she heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), a man asked him about the best deeds, so the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Prayer at the beginning of its time."
